golang.org/x/net/publicsuffix compiles in Mozilla's Public Suffix List
(https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat): its table.go embeds
data/text, data/nodes and data/children, which its gen.go generates from the
list. The package's code is under the BSD-3-Clause license of
golang.org/x/net, in the LICENSE file in the directory above, but the list
carries this notice:

  This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public
  License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this
  file, You can obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

The text of the Mozilla Public License 2.0 is in the file MPL-2.0 next to
this one. The list itself, as it was at the commit of
https://github.com/publicsuffix/list that the package's table.go names, is
/usr/local/share/randomcontainers/azcopy/mpl-sources/public_suffix_list.dat
in this image, and /usr/local/share/randomcontainers/azcopy/source gives its
URL at that commit.
